{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39471898",
      "title": "Making Elements \"Pop\" With Hover Animations",
      "sourceHash": "5abafbd77c46f56ba392db5b4b2f38079eb148dfc75e95fc487a180366479c2c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "Now let's stay in this header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 4.62,
          "en": "for now, because in that header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.62,
          "end": 7.65,
          "en": "there's one other element I'd like to animate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.65,
          "end": 11.771,
          "en": "with help of Framer Motion, and that would be this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.771,
          "end": 14.1,
          "en": "because you might wanna make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.1,
          "end": 18.96,
          "en": "that this button pops a bit more as users hover over it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.96,
          "end": 20.88,
          "en": "maybe by increasing the scale",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.88,
          "end": 23.163,
          "en": "and making it bounce a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.09,
          "end": 27.45,
          "en": "And this is pretty easy to do with Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.45,
          "end": 30.241,
          "en": "since it gives us these realistic natural",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 30.241,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "feeling animations.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 34.94,
          "en": "Therefore, here in the header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.94,
          "end": 39.741,
          "en": "I will now actually also import motion from Framer Motion",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.741,
          "end": 43.8,
          "en": "so that we can turn this standard button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.8,
          "end": 48.063,
          "en": "into a motion button and unlock these special features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.89,
          "end": 53.653,
          "en": "And here I now wanna do something we haven't done before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.653,
          "end": 58.38,
          "en": "because here I don't wanna set the animate prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.38,
          "end": 61.832,
          "en": "because whilst we could do that to change, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 61.832,
          "end": 64.14,
          "en": "the scale of this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.14,
          "end": 67.38,
          "en": "and make it pop as a user hovers over it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.38,
          "end": 69.3,
          "en": "trying to animate this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.3,
          "end": 72.06,
          "en": "with the animate prop here would mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 72.06,
          "end": 76.23,
          "en": "that we also would have to listen to the onHover event here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.23,
          "end": 79.069,
          "en": "to make sure that we change this scale",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.069,
          "end": 81.96000000000001,
          "en": "as the user hovers over this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.96000000000001,
          "end": 86.67,
          "en": "And as the user does, stop hovering over this button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.67,
          "end": 88.62,
          "en": "And whilst this would be possible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.62,
          "end": 91.62,
          "en": "it's a lot of unnecessary work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.62,
          "end": 93.99000000000001,
          "en": "Instead, since it is fairly common",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.99000000000001,
          "end": 96.3,
          "en": "that you wanna animate elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 96.3,
          "end": 98.87100000000001,
          "en": "as users click them or hover over them,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.87100000000001,
          "end": 103.71000000000001,
          "en": "Framer Motion gives you some special props you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.71000000000001,
          "end": 105.57,
          "en": "to those framework components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.57,
          "end": 109.5,
          "en": "which start with while at the beginning.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.5,
          "end": 111.471,
          "en": "And then you get special props like",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 111.471,
          "end": 115.62,
          "en": "whileHover or whileTap, which allow you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.62,
          "end": 119.232,
          "en": "to define animation states that should only apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.232,
          "end": 124.08,
          "en": "whilst the user is tapping or hovering and so on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.08,
          "end": 126.18,
          "en": "or whilst the element is in view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.18,
          "end": 129.213,
          "en": "So whilst it can be seen on the page, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.77,
          "end": 134.461,
          "en": "So here, I'll use whileHover and herein whileHover,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.461,
          "end": 138,
          "en": "we can then set an animation object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138,
          "end": 141.9,
          "en": "as we would add it on the animate prop to, for example",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.9,
          "end": 144.45,
          "en": "change the scale to 1.1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.45,
          "end": 149.45,
          "en": "So increase the scale by 10%, and that's all with that done,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 151.71,
          "end": 156.51,
          "en": "if we save this, this button now pops a little more,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 156.51,
          "end": 158.67000000000002,
          "en": "but as you can see out of the box,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162.393,
          "en": "it just increases in scale and does not really bounce.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.59,
          "end": 166.74,
          "en": "The reason for that is that here, by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.74,
          "end": 170.73,
          "en": "Framer Motion does not apply a spring animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.73,
          "end": 172.77,
          "en": "but this can thankfully be changed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.77,
          "end": 174.55,
          "en": "by setting the transition here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.52,
          "end": 179.43,
          "en": "and then setting the type to spring.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 179.43,
          "end": 181.92,
          "en": "And I showed you this transition prop before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.92,
          "end": 185.1,
          "en": "And the great thing about this prop is that it will control",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.1,
          "end": 186.57,
          "en": "all animations applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.57,
          "end": 188.97,
          "en": "on this element no matter if you set them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 188.97,
          "end": 193.97,
          "en": "with animate, with exit, or with whileHover and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.39,
          "end": 198.23,
          "en": "So here, we can change this to spring and then for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.23,
          "end": 201.61,
          "en": "also configure something called the stiffness",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 202.65,
          "end": 204.589,
          "en": "and set this to 500.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.589,
          "end": 207.141,
          "en": "And this will also have an impact on the bounce effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 207.141,
          "end": 211.74,
          "en": "and it's best if you simply play around with that value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 211.74,
          "end": 216.07999999999998,
          "en": "and also with the mass value here, and set these properties",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.07999999999998,
          "end": 219.813,
          "en": "to different values to get a feeling for their impact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.74,
          "end": 222.15,
          "en": "They do play together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 222.15,
          "end": 225.24,
          "en": "with this spring animation type though, and therefore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 225.24,
          "end": 228.93,
          "en": "with that added here on this button now you'll see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 228.93,
          "end": 233.1,
          "en": "that as I hover on this button and also as I hover away,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 233.1,
          "end": 234.84,
          "en": "we got this nice bounce effect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 234.84,
          "end": 238.503,
          "en": "and it definitely now pops more than it did before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 240.51,
          "end": 243.42,
          "en": "So that's now a nicer look I'd say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.42,
          "end": 246.75,
          "en": "And we therefore now don't just have this modal entry",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.75,
          "end": 247.98,
          "en": "and exit animation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 247.98,
          "end": 251.433,
          "en": "but also a nice popping button to open this modal.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}